      "id": "packages_store_redis_agents_redisrefreshtokenstore",
      "label": "RedisRefreshTokenStore",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "consume() executes as one Lua round trip that reads, deletes, and keeps a family tombstone so token replay revokes the entire token family.",
      "source_file": "packages/store-redis/AGENTS.md",
